{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56088","headline":"通玄赞八首 三 · 杜光庭","name":"通玄赞八首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天堂与地狱，凡夫及圣人。\n悉从方寸起，非复有余因。\n悟则聪明友，迷爲愚瞽隣。\n苦魂服务有识，罪魄亦含神。\n何爲沈恼难，良由不信真。\n弃此身上宝，染彼世间尘。\n既依流浪海，还没死生津。\n若欲渡此苦，安坐自观身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}